flowchart TD
    subgraph Offline[离线流程：资料初始化]
        A1[config.json 默认资料清单]
        A2[app_file_upload.py 初始化/上传入口]
        A3[knowledge_base.py 文本切分与去重]
        A4[DashScope Embedding]
        A5[Chroma 向量库]
        A1 --> A2 --> A3 --> A4 --> A5
    end

    subgraph Online[在线流程：用户问答]
        B1[用户在 Streamlit 提问]
        B2[app_qa.py 获取 session_id]
        B3[file_history_store.py 读取历史消息]
        B4[rag.py 改写检索问题]
        B5[vector_stores.py 召回相关资料]
        B6[rag.py 组装上下文与历史]
        B7[Qwen 生成回答]
        B8[写回历史对话]
        B1 --> B2 --> B3 --> B4 --> B5 --> B6 --> B7 --> B8
    end

    A5 --> B5
